Name: Skia 2D Graphics Library (Ganesh & Graphite)
Short Name: skia
URL: https://skia.googlesource.com/skia.git
Version: 0.156.0
Revision: chrome/m156
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Google's complete 2D graphic library for drawing text, geometries, and images across
Chromium, Android, Flutter, Electron, and CEF. Includes both Ganesh (Direct3D 12, Metal,
Vulkan, OpenGL) and Graphite (modern Dawn/WebGPU-native GPU backend). Consumed in YOLO
via `anyrender_skia` (`skia-safe = 0.156.0`), `tiny-skia = 0.12`, and `vello = 0.11`.

Local Modifications:
Aligned with `skia-safe = 0.156.0` (milestone m156) and `yolo cvm`.
